    "intro_html":  "Pillowy gnocchi and seared chicken thighs in a garlic cream sauce with spinach and parmesan. It eats like the Olive Garden soup grew up into a dinner: \u003cstrong\u003e36 grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e, 624 calories, and about \u003cstrong\u003e$2.06 a bowl\u003c/strong\u003e. Chicken thighs keep it juicy through a week in the fridge.",
