    "cost_closing_html":  "About \u003cstrong\u003e$2.06 a bowl\u003c/strong\u003e for creamy chicken and gnocchi. A gnocchi dish at an Italian restaurant runs $15 to $18, and it will not come with 13 backup dinners waiting at home.",
